  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEPPA award: Tsofen- Gogetit: Growing Opportunities, Growing Employment in Tech</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the activity is to promote greater understanding and cooperation among jewish, israeli-citizen arab, and west bank palestinian youth by building economic ties in the technological sector in stem studies and in the hi-tech field, in order to reduce disparities that destabilize peaceful relations between jews and arabs in israel and in palestine, while also enhancing shared cross-border community building and dialogue. The activity will also promote technology and know-how transfer and provide training, mentorship, and workforce preparedness opportunities or promote Palestinian exports.</narrative>
  </description>
